{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"a2d29f537e2b0ba30","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 MCMC / Cross-Entropy Method (CEM) / 模拟退火变种在组合优化的 2024-2026 应用。\n\n**背景：** 之前调研覆盖了 SA / Tabu / LNS 但没专门看 MCMC / CEM。这两个是统计学派的优化方法，可能给 candidate ordering 提供新思路。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. MCMC for combinatorial sampling\n2. Cross-Entropy Method (CEM, Rubinstein) 现状\n3. Sequential Monte Carlo (SMC) for optimization\n4. Replica Exchange / Parallel Tempering\n5. 在 SAT/CSP/placement 的应用\n6. 跟 RL / GP / LLM evolution 对比\n\n输出末尾：\"是否值得用作 candidate ordering\""},"uuid":"2429571a-b66f-4c53-ae5d-f71725eccf3e","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:12.530Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
